    "type" : "paragraph",
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "A minimal idea-capture register: any signed-in user jots down a one-line idea with an optional note, browses the list, and edits or deletes entries through the platform's standard screens. One new persistable bean, no relationships, no workflow — the design is the entity and its standard surfaces."
